% Problem 24. Chace vol. II pl. 47 (photograph XII, register 1), PDF pp. 141-142; Peet p. 61 (Pl. H).
No. 24
"{A quantity, '7 of it added to it,} becomes it: 19."
\ 1      7
\ '7     1
% no total written (7 and its seventh make 8); 8 is then reckoned with to find 19, with no sentence
  1      8
\ 2      16
  '2     4
\ '4     2
\ '8     1
% no total written; the ticked multipliers give 2 '4 '8, which is then multiplied by 7
\ 1      2 '4 '8
\ 2      4 '2 '4
\ 4      9 '2
% no total written
"The doing as it occurs."
16 '2 '8      % "The quantity"
2 '4 '8       % "'7" (its seventh)
Total 19.
